<title>UK: Enterprise completes Nelson field well.</title>
<headline>Enterprise completes Nelson field well.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britan's Enterprise Oil said on Thursday that it had successfully completed a well on the western flank of the Nelson field in Block 22/11.</p>
<p>&quot;The most recent well drilled from the Nelson platform has demonstrated that the field extends further than previously estimated,&quot; Enterprise said in a statement.</p>
<p>Enterprise said the preliminary estimates indicated that the well may add approximately 25 million barrels of oil to Nelson field recoverable reserves.</p>
<p>&quot;The exact increase will be determined following further work during 1997,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
